1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,380
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Sally does not want to get a job.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,700
She is too lazy.

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:10,340
Also, she does not like following orders.

4
00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,840
She wants to be her own boss.

5
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:17,760
Sally wants to make some easy cash.

6
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,140
She has an idea.

7
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:25,040
She buys 30 packs of chips for $15.

8
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,800
She then sells them to her schoolmates for

9
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,460
a more expensive price.

10
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:35,960
She sells the chips for $1 per bag.

11
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:39,740
The bad thing is that Sally is not

12
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:40,960
allowed to do this.

13
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,960
It is against the school policy.

14
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,560
She must be secretive about it.

15
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:50,720
She sells during lunch period.

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:52,760
People come to her.

17
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:56,780
They sit at her table and pretend like

18
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:57,860
they're talking to her.
